gt;Is this un-Christian of me?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115579355087109803/comments/default/115584729156178675'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115579355087109803/comments/default/115584729156178675'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/08/what-this-is-all-about.html?showComment=1155847260000#c115584729156178675' title=''/><author><name>Kevin Shannon, the Brave Heart of Talk Radio</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15200089251542213856</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/08/what-this-is-all-about.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115579355087109803' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/115579355087109803' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-797534297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2006 at 2:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-115583225671604446</id><published>2006-08-17T10:30:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-08-17T10:30:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will:Great to hear of your new blog.  We wish you ...</title><content type='html'>Will:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Great to hear of your new blog.  We wish you well.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115579355087109803/comments/default/115583225671604446'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/115579355087109803/comments/default/115583225671604446'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominou